-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/.venv/bin/python -m pytest /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/spotify-recsys-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/tests/test_eval_ab.py /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/spotify-recsys-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/tests/test_metrics.py -q 2>&1 | tail -30","description":"Run eval_ab and metrics tests"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_014uUo9qk6NBWqet7iTWHF2h","tool_input":{"command":"/home/drspeedracer/Workspace/spotify-recsys-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/.venv/bin/python -m pytest /home/drspeedracer/Workspace/spotify-recsys-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/tests/test_eval_ab.py -q","description":"Run eval_ab tests"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_014SP9TfNjvEwo4LKbvZFkrk","tool_input":{"command":"/home/drspeedracer/Workspace/spotify-recsys-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/.venv/bin/python -c \"import numpy; print(numpy.__version__)\"","description":"Check venv numpy"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fq3psnH5eWADop6iszjB2y","tool_input":{"command":"PYTHONPATH=/home/drspeedracer/Workspace/spotify-recsys-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages:/home/drspeedracer/Workspace/spotify-recsys-ecosystem-spot-4ec/cadence/src python3 -c \"\nimport numpy, typer\nfrom cadence.eval.eval_ab import compare, format_report, label, parse_overrides, apply_overrides\nfrom cadence.eval.metrics import MetricAccumulator\nprint('imports ok', numpy.__version__)\n\"","description":"Import modules with venv site-packages on path"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_017SqmRxDCGDaP9sY9xZhS3V","tool_input":{"command":"git fetch origin","timeout":180000,"description":"Fetch to check current remote main"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":3,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":3,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":1,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":3,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{"general-purpose":3}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":161,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Done. **PR #11: https://github.com/jamesponwith/spotify-recsys-ecosystem/pull/11**\n\n**Bead taken:** spot-4ec (P1, `w:2`) — add `cadence eval-ab` and price `rrf_k` and the seven channel weights.\n\n**What shipped.** `cadence eval-ab --k 0 --limit 400 --arm rrf_k=30` (also `make -C cadence eval-ab`). Both arms share one catalog, one planner, intents planned once, and the identical challenge list — so the per-challenge difference is a clean read on the knob. The report prints mean A, mean B, paired delta, paired ±2×SE, a `moved` count, a detectable/not verdict, and the *unpaired* band beside it, which is the bead's actual point. Only `rrf_k` and the seven weights are settable; `mmr_lambda` and the sequencer weights are refused by name with the reason, from a list derived off `AssemblyConfig`.\n\n**Gate:** green — 187 tests (33 new), ruff check + format, mypy clean.\n\n**Acceptance, honestly:** the *decision rule* is verified hermetically — tests pin vectors to the bead's statistics and assert −0.00109/0.00185 is not detectable while −0.00579/0.00222 is. The *measurement* is not reproduced: this worktree has no `data/processed`, so the end-to-end test skips. One `make -C cadence eval-ab` on the data host is the remaining step, and `docs/EVALUATION.md` marks those figures \"Pending confirmation\" rather than restating them as results.\n\n**Two things worth your attention:**\n\n1. **spot-7lj is closed as \"PR #9 merged\" but its content is not on `main`** — the PR diff confirms it (metrics.py +43/−8). `eval-ab` can't report a paired SE without `paired_deltas`, so the first commit cherry-picks it verbatim; it's a no-op if #9 later lands. The board and the remote disagree, which may affect other beads that depend on #9.\n2. **The self-review caught a real one.** `--reranker` defaulted off, so the acceptance command would have priced the knob on the fusion-only path (k=0 R-prec 0.0709) while the bead's anchors — 0.1429, floor 0.0149 — are the `full_reranked` cell. Reranking now defaults on, and a missing `reranker.pkl` is a refusal rather than a silent downgrade.\n\n**Review panel:** 18 findings, all in `.flywheel/review.jsonl` — 13 accepted and fixed, 2 rejected, 3 deferred; security found nothing.\n\n**Left out:** the shared scoring loop between `score_arm` and `run_eval._run_engine_config` — the extraction lands in `run_eval.py`, which PR #9 rewrote and which isn't in this base, so it would conflict. Filed as **spot-24j**, blocked on this bead.\n\n**Two cleanup items I couldn't do:** `cadence/_smoke_eval_ab.py` is an untracked scratch script — in no commit, but the sandbox blocked `rm`, `find -delete` and `git clean` on that path, so please delete it. And I can't remove this worktree from inside it. The bead stays open until the PR merges; I did not merge it.","ttft_ms":1738,"type":"result","duration_ms":1803083,"uuid":"c7ec28a2-1540-42d4-96c3-d5e6e6d55046","ttft_stream_ms":1000,"time_to_request_ms":124,"queued_turn_count":0}
